# Registry of every static-analysis suppression allowed in this repository.
# Checked by harness/guard/suppressions.sh.
# Format: <file> :: <directive> :: <trimmed source line>
# Prefer fixing the finding. Add an entry only with a reason in the comment above it.

# gosec G304: the file path is the constant policy location, not user input.
harness/guard/archcheck/main.go :: //nolint :: raw, err := os.ReadFile(file) //nolint:gosec // the policy path is a constant
